 "template": "In Odoo (already signed in as admin), go to Sales > Orders > Quotations and find the DRAFT quotation whose customer is '{{v1}}' (there should be exactly one; open it). First verify what you see and report it: the quotation name/reference, the URL record id, the customer, and both order lines with their products, quantities and unit prices, plus the current Untaxed Amount (expected: line 1 = {{v3}} qty 3, line 2 = {{v4}} qty 2, untaxed around £581.00 — if what you find differs, say so explicitly and do not proceed). Then, on that same quotation, change the FIRST line's Quantity from 3 to 5 (leave the second line at qty 2) and save. Report the new Untaxed Amount the app computes after saving, plus the Taxes and Total amounts.",
